From 21065644a5cc3c0da7671729cad58136cb4f954f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:56:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: comm closure link fixes: native-provided for 21
 already-compiled functions, drop 6 Missing traps now translated

Run 53 link (main 94703ac): 27 multiple definitions. 21 are functions the decomp already compiles (unk_0202C034,
unk_0202C730, unk_02030A98, unk_02034354, unk_020379A0, unk_02068FC8) that the 0127 closure translated a second time;
list them in native-provided.json so the translator calls the compiled ones. 6 are Missing() traps (ov00_021E5CA0,
021E69A8, 021E6A4C, 021E7130, 021E7314, sub_020588DC) that the closure now defines. ss3ds_game.sh re-syncs the staged
native-provided.json too.
---
